# Existing history appears immediately; removed and never-played games stay out.
phase SetClock
press a
phase Shelf
snap recent-grid
press a
snap recent-shelf
# Mega Drive shell edges vary slightly with render timing (also captured in md.sim).
press right
idle
grab recent-md
press x
press b
idle
grab recent-cancel-search
press menu
phase QuickMenu
press b
phase Shelf
press b
snap recent-grid
press a
press a
phase Playing 20000
hold menu 1500
phase Shelf 20000
snap recent-after-play
press b
snap recent-grid
